Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 呐 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.19,0:00:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}世界决斗狂欢节上我们学校
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进入决赛大会的人居然有2个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙大人倒是理所当然没想到那孩子也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对 对。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯～那个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是什么来着？那孩子的招牌台词。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）嗯～…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）一飞冲天 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}签名 怎么样？呐！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}签名 想要的话 别客气…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？签名！签名呢？我给你签。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 签名 怎么样？我给你签哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸）怎么感觉 九十九君有点得意忘形？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（圣）相当呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）那个笨蛋…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底就是得意忘形了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 呐 呐！签名 签名！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！好痛痛…好痛 好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛啊 小鸟！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.74,0:01:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）你给我适可而止啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是啊 我们进决赛了耶。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微飘一下也没什么吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个 这个。看看这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.15,0:01:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锵！决赛前夜祭的邀请函。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今晚好像要在心园举办哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟她们）哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗名流也会来好多呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯茜）凯特穿什么去好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂……喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被邀请的人明明是我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.22,0:01:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）我想到个好主意啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.55,0:01:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能只让游马一个人尝到甜头啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜来自世界各地的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.43,0:01:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者们齐聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开激战的 世界决斗狂欢节。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从惨烈的预选中脱颖而出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 终于拿到了决赛大会的门票！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管什么样的强敌 都放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要 拿下冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）等等 托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）把我也强化啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像对III那样！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）我对你 还有III 都失望了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}III他啊 可是为了你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和 No.卡的原版战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然变成了…那副模样！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想要的是结果啊，我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然不能对你们抱有期待那就找别人好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.51,0:04:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此，我才把他拉进了这场大会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这样的原因啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么…为什么！？托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）快斗大人，已经到极限了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再继续用光子模式使用 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持续回收的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.87,0:05:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）看来你相当
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勉强自己啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）没事吧？快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快…快斗大人的身体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）如你所见，没问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须是这样才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡聚集到心园市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，接下来才是重头戏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对你可是寄予厚望的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 关于哈特的事 就按约定…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然 不必担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 对了 今晚的前夜祭我会等着你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有 No.卡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那双眼睛亲眼看看也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该不坏吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 心园这地方不管什么时候来 都超～厉害啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的！ 非常漂亮呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！ 小鸟这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然这么起劲地打扮了一番…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鸡也要靠衣装的意思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么叫鸡啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.37,0:06:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特你不也挺合适的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化猫的cosplay！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化… 气死我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别闹了，你们几个……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易才来一趟心园。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）心园……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:06:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是Dr.费卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所建设{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从小孩到大人都能尽情享受的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦想乐园。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些不幸的孩子们会被优先邀请{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一理念受到了全世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毫不吝惜的赞誉。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其总面积是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，懂得还挺多啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来从……那里得到的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是拥有这个世界一切知识的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.10,0:07:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}记忆碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么感觉那居高临下的态度要变得更加居高临下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）这里就是派对的主会场！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.75,0:07:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说到底就是红毯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得 好像成了明星一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喵 喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行 不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无关人员不能从这里进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！我有那个叫邀请函的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看 就像这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.49,0:07:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:07:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 游马又…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我 晋级了决赛…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这种小孩子怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是决赛晋级者！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就把邀请函拿出来看看！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了，回去回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凡事都有内幕的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有个主意乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那位是女性决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.05,0:08:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米尔菲尤·克拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}红毯也有内幕的乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难得的礼服都白费了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，真是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋和游马都要看怎么用乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀！请给我签名。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要！我是你的粉丝。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那位是晋级决赛大会的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.52,0:09:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我说了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这群坏小鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）我还以为是谁呢这不是九十九游马吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，真能闹腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……没带邀请函就跑到这儿来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.54,0:09:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙虽然长这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是决赛大会的参赛者。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，但是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说的话你信不过是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是……不……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的气场也相当……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好……好厉害！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是决赛大会晋级者之一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}中南美的黑豹，人称加西亚黑豹！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.71,0:11:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）这边是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白夜的贵公子——贝尔曼坂田……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接……接着……嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坠落者！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在无数决斗大会中凭借压倒性的强大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将众人打入恐惧深渊的暗之三人组！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼呢？快斗也来了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.89,0:11:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？那家伙是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}：九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 一马先生的儿子吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的父亲还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在星光体世界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这样子可不像平时的你。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么让春人遭遇那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便是曾经的师父……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）我也绝不原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么，到底是为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目的是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.47,0:12:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们只是遵从托隆的意志。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早会见的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道要在决赛……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭这副身体，你觉得能赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和托隆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不在啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明有好多事想问他。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）好，请。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一个，是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉丝服务可是我的信条嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}滚开！别挡道！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你平时那张贫嘴呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.33,0:13:22.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于要来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会用我的全部来打败你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多洛瓦）看起来好痛苦呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多洛瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的样子我一直觉得不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:13:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在医务室听到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:02.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的身体已经……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是恶趣味啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.27,0:14:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在同情哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不得不收集 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这件事我也明白。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你不该参加决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮不到你来对我指手画脚。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛上 V会出场。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掳走哈鲁特的那个叫托隆的家伙也会出场。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最重要的是那家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.48,0:14:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 绝对不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是 对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:43.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Dr.菲卡）看来这场前夜祭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是热闹非凡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这也是因为计划进展顺利。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主角们都到齐了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:54.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有一个人 尚未现身。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一个叫托隆的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:14:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您有印象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我——
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为心园的代表
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向晋级决赛大会的各位 献上拥抱。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 德之助君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是没能入场吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是不见踪影呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}莫非 你就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 就是业余最强的决斗者。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人称黎明吸血鬼的 诺斯费拉图中岛。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之 请给我签名！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据说是签名狂人委员长呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常感谢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背面中的背面。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.44,0:15:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背面？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心在燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}女士们 先生们。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.71,0:16:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及 各位决斗者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们享受派对吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗嘉年华也终于从明天开始就是决赛大会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里再次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为大家介绍23名决赛选手的勇者们。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先… 哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～ 好大的蛋糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我叫 特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叫特隆哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.68,0:17:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个就是特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.72,0:17:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大叔。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.01,0:18:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大叔，你们这些人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会把你们打趴下。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊，最喜欢蛋糕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，那边的大哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.27,0:18:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决赛见哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能看见我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.39,0:19:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，找到了！就是那家伙，那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的冒牌货！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了乌拉！啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们又在闹事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不是啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底就是德之助你在乌拉背后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干了那种事对吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！给我站住～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说了是误会啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.29,0:20:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮不到你来担心我。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你只要想着和我的了断就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:10.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会全力……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也是，我也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别误会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要全力打倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.06,0:21:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是你。是星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哈！你这～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（乌尔夫）你是说想雇我们对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（沃尔夫）我们可不便宜。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先付定金。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的等活干完再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后呢？目标是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个叫九十九游马的男人。

